Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:25:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(03-38): PDF pictures become captioned image chunks
 behind RAG_PDF_IMAGE_CHUNKS

- selectPictures: 0.02 page-area floor, 30 per document in page order, counts in the stage outcome
- images stage: caption each kept picture once with the shared captioner (progress in the images slice, resumable), scan captions, then store the pictures under rag/<tenant_key>/<lineage_id>/<version>/ in chat-images and add image chunks with page, section path and image_url
- a caption that matches the injection scan quarantines the document before anything is stored publicly or written as an image chunk
- parse keeps pictures.json (switch on only) and rehydrate rebuilds image chunks from stored captions after resume
- the image_chunks_unavailable warning of plan 03-32 is gone: the switch now does the work

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
